{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Subterranean Anomaly Horror Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped deep beneath the earth in an  underground complex, you awaken to the echoing <i>beep</i> of a countdown. <strong>Explosives have been armed</strong>. The lights flicker. The walls breathe. You don\u2019t know how you got here\u2014but you do know one thing: when the music stops, so do you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a looping, ever-changing labyrinth where nothing stays the same for long. Shadows twist wrong. Objects duplicate. Faces lie. You're being watched, but you\u2019re not sure by what\u2014or <i>how many</i>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/Clip04.gif?t=1746990320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every corridor may conceal an anomaly: some subtle, some grotesque. Identify them. Memorize patterns. Trust your instincts, not your eyes. The music is your timer, and once it ends... so does your chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you spot what shouldn't be there before it's too late?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/Clip05.gif?t=1746990320\" /><br> About the game<br>Play time<br>15 -60 mins<br>Over 18 Anomalies<br>Multiple endings</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387100?t=1746990320","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387100?t=1746990320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/93f1ac9b3225f6c6902396e5a5761d3d3ba05ceb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746990320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/93f1ac9b3225f6c6902396e5a5761d3d3ba05ceb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746990320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Subterranean Anomaly Horror Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped deep beneath the earth in an  underground complex, you awaken to the echoing <i>beep</i> of a countdown. <strong>Explosives have been armed</strong>. The lights flicker. The walls breathe. You don\u2019t know how you got here\u2014but you do know one thing: when the music stops, so do you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a looping, ever-changing labyrinth where nothing stays the same for long. Shadows twist wrong. Objects duplicate. Faces lie. You're being watched, but you\u2019re not sure by what\u2014or <i>how many</i>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/Clip04.gif?t=1746990320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every corridor may conceal an anomaly: some subtle, some grotesque. Identify them. Memorize patterns. Trust your instincts, not your eyes. The music is your timer, and once it ends... so does your chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you spot what shouldn't be there before it's too late?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/Clip05.gif?t=1746990320\" /><br> About the game<br>Play time<br>15 -60 mins<br>Over 18 Anomalies<br>Multiple endings</p>","developers":["Construct Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/3dbeae848e72fb3c6ea6ed015c4e7a59244bd9d3/header.jpg?t=1746990320","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<stron